[2026-03-15T20:11:04.886Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RuhNbZhnEQymxxvYVYrnGm","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Skill\n     2→\n     3→You are maintaining an application by addressing bug reports, making sure the app follows requirements,\n     4→and polishing it to improve quality. A single round of maintenance is done in the following stages,\n     5→with task skill files in `skills/tasks/maintain/` (and `skills/tasks/` for deployment)\n     6→for additional instructions. You will continue performing additional rounds of maintenance as needed.\n     7→\n     8→1. mergeFromMain.md: Pull the latest skills and infrastructure from `main` into the current branch.\n     9→\n    10→2. fixBugReport.md: Fix the app to resolve any open bug reports.\n    11→\n    12→3. reviewBugReport.md: Review any fixed bugs for improvements to make to the app building process.\n    13→\n    14→4. checkDirectives.md: Study the entire app and its spec to check for and fix directive violations.\n    15→\n    16→5. polishApp.md: Improve the app's overall quality.\n    17→\n    18→6. deployment.md: Deploy the updated app to production.\n    19→\n    20→Add all tasks to the queue in execution order:\n    21→\n    22→```bash\n    23→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts <<'EOF'\n    24→[\n    25→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/mergeFromMain.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"MergeFromMain: Merge latest main into branch\"] },\n    26→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/fixBugReport.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Fix open bug reports\"] },\n    27→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/reviewBugReport.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Review fixed bug reports\"] },\n    28→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/checkDirectives.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Check directive compliance\"] },\n    29→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/polishApp.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Polish app quality\"] },\n    30→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Deploy to production\"] }\n    31→]\n    32→EOF\n    33→```\n    34→\n    35→The worker will pick up and process each task in order (mergeFromMain → fixBugReport → reviewBugReport → checkDirectives → polishApp → deployment).\n    36→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"799916c8-5100-4b03-8407-d4b722ad1d03","uuid":"f7b581a8-c1fb-43f2-85aa-c32ee4c40a0c","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/skills/messages/maintainApp.md","content":"# Skill\n\nYou are maintaining an application by addressing bug reports, making sure the app follows requirements,\nand polishing it to improve quality. A single round of maintenance is done in the following stages,\nwith task skill files in `skills/tasks/maintain/` (and `skills/tasks/` for deployment)\nfor additional instructions. You will continue performing additional rounds of maintenance as needed.\n\n1. mergeFromMain.md: Pull the latest skills and infrastructure from `main` into the current branch.\n\n2. fixBugReport.md: Fix the app to resolve any open bug reports.\n\n3. reviewBugReport.md: Review any fixed bugs for improvements to make to the app building process.\n\n4. checkDirectives.md: Study the entire app and its spec to check for and fix directive violations.\n\n5. polishApp.md: Improve the app's overall quality.\n\n6. deployment.md: Deploy the updated app to production.\n\nAdd all tasks to the queue in execution order:\n\n```bash\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts <<'EOF'\n[\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/mergeFromMain.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"MergeFromMain: Merge latest main into branch\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/fixBugReport.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Fix open bug reports\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/reviewBugReport.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Review fixed bug reports\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/checkDirectives.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Check directive compliance\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/maintain/polishApp.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Polish app quality\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Deploy to production\"] }\n]\nEOF\n```\n\nThe worker will pick up and process each task in order (mergeFromMain → fixBugReport → reviewBugReport → checkDirectives → polishApp → deployment).\n","numLines":36,"startLine":1,"totalLines":36}}}
